":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Tn1r7","user":{"login":"paddy-exe","id":38077837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MDc3ODM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38077837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe","html_url":"https://github.com/paddy-exe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-14T15:22:00Z","updated_at":"2024-11-14T15:22:00Z","body":"> Can you link that original PR? Is this new PR meant to supersede it, or it's a follow-up and KoBeWi's PR needs to be merged first?\r\n\r\nIt's the follow-up PR to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97058 but it is in VERY early stages. I am trying to wrap my head around the code. Clay gave me instructions on how it could be done for the compatability renderer. All the rest is already done","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2476694267/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2495385806","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99230#issuecomment-2495385806","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99230","id":2495385806,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UvJDO","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-23T07:41:36Z","updated_at":"2024-11-23T07:41:36Z","body":"I started writing up what to do, then I realized it was less work for me to just show you, so here is a patch that gets 2D instance uniforms working in 2D.\r\n\r\n[0001-Finish-GLES3-support.patch](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17878926/0001-Finish-GLES3-support.patch)\r\n\r\nThe final piece before this is ready is getting it to work with the \"use_parent_material\" property. CanvasItems often inherit the material from their parent. Currently it mostly works, but the editor doesn't expose the instance property for updating so you can't set the instance uniform in the editor. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2495385806/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2499954436","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99230#issuecomment-2499954436","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99230","id":2499954436,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VAkcE","user":{"login":"paddy-exe","id":38077837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MDc3ODM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38077837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe","html_url":"https://github.com/paddy-exe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-26T08:18:35Z","updated_at":"2024-11-26T08:18:35Z","body":"> I started writing up what to do, then I realized it was less work for me to just show you, so here is a patch that gets 2D instance uniforms working in 2D.\r\n> \r\n> [0001-Finish-GLES3-support.patch](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17878926/0001-Finish-GLES3-support.patch)\r\n> \r\n> The final piece before this is ready is getting it to work with the \"use_parent_material\" property. CanvasItems often inherit the material from their parent. Currently it mostly works, but the editor doesn't expose the instance property for updating so you can't set the instance uniform in the editor.\r\n\r\nThank you! I applied your patch except for this part as I couldn't figure out where this goes:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nmaterial_storage->shaders.canvas_shader.version_set_uniform(CanvasShaderGLES3::SPECULAR_SHININESS_IN, state.canvas_instance_batches[i].specular_shininess, shader_version, variant, specialization);\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2499954436/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2501297711","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99230#issuecomment-2501297711","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99230","id":2501297711,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VFsYv","user":{"login":"paddy-exe","id":38077837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MDc3ODM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38077837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe","html_url":"https://github.com/paddy-exe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-26T16:20:02Z","updated_at":"2024-11-27T15:18:33Z","body":"Updated with all feedback. Once the code changes are approved I will squash them so we have one commit at the end. The current two commits are for easier checking of the changes I made versus the previous authors